u, and don't step in the furrows I just opened.","zh":"下雨了，好。你绕着点走，别踩我刚开的沟。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The wheat came into ear nearly half a month late this year, and the ears are thin. My father farmed forty years and says he never saw the like.","zh":"今年的麦子抽穗晚了快半个月，穗子也瘪。我爹种了四十年地，说从没见过这样的。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The fort has been taking men again. Both the neighbours' sons went last month, and there hasn't been a letter since.","zh":"要塞又来征人了。隔壁家两个儿子上个月都走了，到现在一封信也没有。"}}]}}},{"id":"redmarch.hawkholm.folk11.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.hawkholm.folk11"}},{"id":"redmarch.hawkholm.folk11.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.hawkholm.folk11"}},{"id":"redmarch.hawkholm.folk12","type":"actor/person/child","name":{"en":"Ludmila Boarfield","zh":"柳德米拉·猪田"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"redmarch.hawkholm.home-6","x":2,"y":2},"facing":"down","props":{"age":15,"household":"redmarch.hawkholm.h5","purse":1,"favourite":"item/material/gold_ingot"},"tags":["minor"],"contents":["redmarch.hawkholm.folk12.coin0"],"look":{"body":"woman","parts":{"hair":"hair.braid","face":"face.keen","hat":"hat.cap","outfit":"outfit.dress","legs":"legs.hose","shoes":"shoes.buckled"},"colors":{"skin":"light","hair":"chestnut","eyes":"storm","hat.1":"woad","outfit.1":"woad","outfit.2":"linen","legs.1":"undyed","shoes.1":"plum"}},"npc":{"role":"child","schedule":[{"from":20,"to":7,"map":"redmarch.hawkholm.home-6","x":2,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"redmarch.hawkholm.home-6","x":1,"y":5,"activity":"play"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"redmarch.hawkholm.home-6","x":4,"y":4,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"redmarch.hawkholm.home-6","x":1,"y":5,"activity":"play"},{"from":18,"to":20,"map":"redmarch.hawkholm","x":18,"y":22,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many peopl